		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Troglodytes fleshwarped by drow flesh crafters. Larger, stinkier, more brutal than their normal kin.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 9, <strong>HP</strong> 31, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 claw +5 (1d6) and 1 bite +5 (2d6) or 1 spew, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> -1, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Spew</strong>. Spew acidic vomit on one target within near, DEX 15+ or 1d6 damage and sickened for 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Troglodyte Stench</strong>. Living creatures within near, CON 15+ or DISADV for 5 rounds. Immune to stench for 24 hours once successful.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
